  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For a perfect gas, two pressures <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are shown in figure. The graph shows</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0094_e82de8fea175.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 195px;\" /></p>"
  },
